WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.920
[Narrator] Legacy banking splits customers across phone menus,
static apps, and product silos.

2
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:13.050
[Narrator] Google Cloud CX Agent Studio turns banking into one
continuous conversation across voice and mobile.

3
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.380
[Chloe] Give me a quick look at my spending this month.

4
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:21.350
[Concierge] One charge is flagged on your screen:
£45 at Netflix on 21 November,

5
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.480
up from £17.99 in October. Do you recognise that charge?

6
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:30.280
[Chloe] Yes, let's discuss that later.
I first want to see my spending at Tesco's this month.

7
00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.540
[Concierge] Of course, we can come back to Netflix whenever you are ready.

8
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:38.700
At Tesco, you spent £80.75 across three payments in November.

9
00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:41.630
[Chloe] Can I see a three-month view of my Tesco spend?

10
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:49.140
[Concierge] Over the past three months at Tesco, your spending went
from £46.40 in September to £52.50 in October,

11
00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:54.510
and £80.75 in November, totalling £179.65,

12
00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.690
which is up £28.25 from October.

13
00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:00.300
[Chloe] Going back to Netflix, I want to cancel it.

14
00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:04.560
[Concierge] To cancel Netflix, sign in to your account,
head to the Manage Membership page,

15
00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:08.200
and select Cancel, then confirm by choosing Finish Cancellation.

16
00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:12.300
[Chloe] How can that £45 a month impact my savings goals?

17
00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:17.460
[Concierge] Adding £45 a month from Netflix lifts your monthly saving to £245,

18
00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:23.780
shaving four months off your timeline and reaching your £10,000 target
in 19 months, by June 2028.

19
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:29.000
[David] What would overpaying my mortgage by £200 a month save me?

20
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:34.200
[Concierge] It would shave 1 year and 4 months off your remaining term,
down to 8 years and 8 months,

21
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.980
and save £4,547.27 in total interest.

22
00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.590
[David] Compare the fixed-rate renewal options on my mortgage.

23
00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:49.120
[Concierge] The 5-year Fixed at 3.75% would be £1,482.91 a month,

24
00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:51.360
saving £10.51 a month.

25
00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:57.800
[Tom] I'm renting right now.
How much could I roughly borrow for a mortgage on my first home?

26
00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:05.070
[Concierge] You do not hold a Cloudbank mortgage right now, though based on
an indicative 4.5 times income multiple on £42,000,

27
00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:11.560
that suggests borrowing up to £189,000, or a property budget around £224,000

28
00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.840
once your £35,000 First Home Deposit is complete, with £20,800 left to go.

29
00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:23.800
[Narrator] And because CX Agent Studio is omnichannel by design,
banks deploy once across voice and chat,

30
00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:29.750
whether a customer speaks or types inside the mobile app,
browses on the web, or calls in over the telephone.

31
00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:35.800
[Narrator] Higher containment, faster multi-product journeys,
and built-in regulatory guardrails,

32
00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.560
powered by Google Cloud CX Agent Studio.
